                    42.0,
                    256.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) Average weekly hours worked prior to entering military service will determine the position to which an employee is assigned upon returning from such service, it being understood, however, that this will not constitute an indefinite guarantee of weekly hours in the case of part time employees.",
            "block_bbox": [
                42,
                258,
