            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 8. It is understood that Stewards of the Union shall at all times be full time employees and shall be the last to be laid off in any case, subject to their ability to perform the job in question. The Union shall furnish the Company with a complete list of Stewards which shall be supplemented from time to time as may be necessary.",
